<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish 1997 Budget day set for January 22.</title>
<headline>Irish 1997 Budget day set for January 22.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's 1997 Budget day will be January 22, the day parliament returns to work after its Christmas recess, Irish Prime Minister John Bruton said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 660 3377</p>
</text>
